json5p/scalar
description: Atomic token - a JSON5 scalar or a pointer
- >
  An atomic token of json5p is either any JSON5 scalar, or a **pointer** - and since a pointer
  dereferences to the node its path names, it stands wherever a value can. See the subchapters
  below for the two:
- !!<format: text/x-json5p> |
  'text'   0x2A   true   null   *": pets: 1"
- *..:..:06-json5_code:01-json5_scalar
- *: 01-json5p_pointer
